.TH PWD 1
.SH NAME
pwd \- working directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pwd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Pwd
prints the path name of the working directory,
as the kernel records it.
.SH SOURCE
.B cmd/pwd/main.odin
.SH SEE ALSO
.I cd
in
.IR rc (1),
.IR chdir (2)
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
The exit status is empty, or
.B getwd
when the kernel cannot supply the name.
The name is at most 1024 bytes.
